---
description: Mini DWH project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a local mini-DWH project.

Environment:
- Windows host
- VS Code / Cursor Dev Container
- Python 3.11
- SQL Server 2022 in Docker

Critical DB connection:
- From inside Dev Container, use: host.docker.internal,1433
- From Windows tools, use: 127.0.0.1,1433
- Target database is always: mini_dwh
- Never write DWH objects to master

Run pattern:
cd /workspaces/mini-dwh
export PYTHONPATH=$(pwd)

Architecture:
- Bronze = raw delivery-aware ingestion
- Silver = business-grain current + history
- Gold = analytics marts

Core IDs:
- batch_id = technical pipeline run
- delivery_id = source artifact / API pull
- source_record_id = source business key

Important:
- Bronze should be append-only by delivery
- RELOAD should not delete old Bronze rows
- Silver history uses SCD2
- Gold should read from Silver, not Bronze